		{"id":"92dbf267ede26ad0","x":6920,"y":-1744,"width":456,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`btree_split_child(...)`分裂已满节点，维持 B 树平衡"},
		{"id":"b2bc74d79a35ea31","x":6920,"y":-1920,"width":430,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`btree_create_node(int isLeaf)`创建一个 B 树节点"},
		{"id":"f4bd7a5d1fac7173","x":5677,"y":-1566,"width":250,"height":81,"type":"text","text":"`admin_menu(BTreeNode **root)`显示管理员菜单并调用管理功能"},
		{"id":"51916e7b74297398","x":5738,"y":-678,"width":250,"height":90,"type":"text","text":"`user_menu(BTreeNode *root)`显示普通用户菜单并调用用户功能"},
		{"id":"cf7a6948ddc1b90e","x":5667,"y":-1955,"width":270,"height":260,"type":"text","text":"```\n管理员：\n1. 查询设备\n2. 添加设备\n3. 删除设备\n4. 修改设备\n5. 输出全部设备\n6. 统计设备\n7. 发布通知\n8. 回复咨询\n```"},
		{"id":"156a67f9776d3dda","x":5770,"y":-930,"width":187,"height":157,"type":"text","text":"```\n普通用户：\n1. 查询设备\n2. 查看通知\n3. 提交咨询\n```"},
		{"id":"24588584b85e6ddd","x":5020,"y":-1200,"width":500,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`main()`初始化系统、读取文件、显示主菜单、退出时保存数据"}
	],
